5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know exactly how much we'll spend! Let's look at the all-in rates and the offshore house prices.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm more concerned about the logistics. I'll check the ferry and train times, and how we get around by train and bus.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Rin on the money, but I want to see how the bills are split. I'll check the separately booked rooms cost and all-in rates.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
