30,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island houses are cheap per night, but all-in rates might be unfair if some of us eat less!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The island trip is a logistical nightmare. Two days just for travel? No thanks. The train to the valley is much faster.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Renting a whole building is the only way to ensure the cost is split evenly without someone losing out.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island house sounds terrible—one cold bathroom for all of us? And the inn has a strict schedule and shared futons.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,It seems we struggle with balance. Last year we were too separate; a shared house might be too crowded.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, so the island house is the fairest for the bill? But @Takumi says the bath is cold!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, if we want balance, the city is best. No planning needed, just hop on a train.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, yes, a single bill is cleaner. But the city's separate bookings lead to price discrepancies.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,I hate the idea of everyone in one room on futons. A city room with a door sounds way better.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"A city break might lead to us drifting apart again, like last year. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just don't want any surprises with the money. If the island is cheap, maybe we can afford better food?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The valley is a good compromise. Fast travel and a set location, though the bus is a bit limited.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we go to the city, we risk the same financial mess as last time. I prefer the island or valley.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I can't do the island. One bathroom is a dealbreaker. I'll take the city or maybe the valley.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The valley inn keeps us together for meals but allows for some movement in the town.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm leaning towards the island because it's cheap, but I don't want Takumi to be grumpy!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be rational. The island wastes too much time. The valley is efficient.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"The valley inn's all-in rate is a bit rigid, but the booking is simpler than the city.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"As long as I have a decent place to wash and some space, I'm okay with the valley.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The valley seems to offer the best chance of staying connected without feeling trapped.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
