55,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'll vote for the Island! It's the most adventurous and the cheapest per night.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town. The travel time is the only thing that matters to me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll go with the Hot Spring Town. It's a better financial compromise than the city.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Definitely the City Break. I need my own room and a flexible schedule to actually sleep.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote for the Hot Spring Town. It balances our need for togetherness and personal space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, please reconsider! The island would be so much fun!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, the city is too chaotic. The valley is peaceful and fast to reach.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,The city is too disorganized. The valley is the logical choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,I can't compromise on sleep and bathrooms. I'm sticking with the city.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The valley is the most stable option for the group's dynamic.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,"If everyone else wants the valley, I guess I'll go with that too. I just want us all to be happy!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Glad we're agreeing. Efficiency wins.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,It's the most sensible decision.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm still not happy about the futons, but I'll cave if it's the only way.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It's a fair result.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
